+# ALFA: EDM4hep production with the ARC particle identification
+
+Delphes cards of the ALFA detector concept (FCC-ee) with the ARC RICH, in two gas variants, and everything needed to
+produce EDM4hep files with k4SimDelphes, including the ARC particle-ID of every track.
+
+| file | content |
+|---|---|
+| `cards/delphes_card_ALFA_Xe2bar.tcl` | ALFA, ARC gas = xenon at 2 bar (main design) |
+| `cards/delphes_card_ALFA_C4F10.tcl` | ALFA, ARC gas = C4F10 at 1 bar (comparison) |
+| `edm4hep_output_config_ALFA.tcl` | k4SimDelphes output configuration for the ALFA cards |
+| `pythia/zh_Hxx_template.cmnd` | Pythia8: e+e- -> ZH at 240 GeV, Z -> nu nu, H -> xx (placeholders filled by the script) |
+| `produce_zh.sh` | one EDM4hep file: `produce_zh.sh <Xe2bar\|C4F10> <bb\|cc\|ss\|uu\|dd\|gg> <chunk> <nevents> <out.root>` |
+
+The two cards are identical except for the `ARCPID` block. Both are calibrated on a cell-averaged k4geo full simulation
+of the ARC in ALFA_o1_v01 (each on its own gas); the calibration and validation are documented in the ALFA ARC study.
+
+## Requirements: Delphes with the ARCPID module
+
+The cards use the `ARCPID` Delphes module (per-track Cherenkov emulation of the ARC, pi/K/p hypotheses) and its `Track`
+members. They are not in Delphes master: build Delphes from the ALFA branch (`alfa-arc` of the ALFA Delphes fork,
+7 commits on delphes/delphes master `b0465ee`):
+
+```bash
+source /cvmfs/sw.hsf.org/key4hep/setup.sh          # or the nightlies
+git clone -b alfa-arc https://github.com/apranikstar/delphes.git delphes-alfa
+cd delphes-alfa && ./configure && make -j8 && cd ..
+```
+
+## Build k4SimDelphes against it
+
+```bash
+git clone -b alfa https://github.com/apranikstar/k4SimDelphes.git && cd k4SimDelphes
+mkdir build && cd build
+cmake .. -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=../install -DBUILD_FRAMEWORK=OFF -DBUILD_EVTGEN_READER=OFF -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF \
+         -DDELPHES_LIBRARY=$PWD/../../delphes-alfa/libDelphes.so \
+         -DDELPHES_INCLUDE_DIR=$PWD/../../delphes-alfa \
+         -DDELPHES_EXTERNALS_INCLUDE_DIR=$PWD/../../delphes-alfa/external
+make -j8 install
+```
+
+CMake prints `Delphes has ARCPID: EFlowTrack_PID filled with the ARC hypotheses` when the ARC members are found.
+Pass the Delphes paths explicitly: otherwise the Delphes of the key4hep stack (without ARCPID) may be picked up.
+The installed binaries carry the right RPATH (this branch fixes the install RPATH to `lib64` on EL9), so no
+`LD_LIBRARY_PATH` or `LD_PRELOAD` is needed.
+
+## Run
+
+```bash
+K4SIMDELPHES_BIN=$PWD/install/bin/DelphesPythia8_EDM4HEP \
+  examples/ALFA/produce_zh.sh Xe2bar bb 0 10000 Hbb_Xe2bar_0.edm4hep.root
+```
+
+About 100 events/s per core. The Pythia seed depends only on (decay, chunk): Xe2bar and C4F10 files of the same chunk
+contain the same generated events. The usual k4SimDelphes command also works with any Pythia card:
+`DelphesPythia8_EDM4HEP cards/delphes_card_ALFA_Xe2bar.tcl edm4hep_output_config_ALFA.tcl <pythia.cmnd> <out.root>`.
+
+## Output
+
+The standard k4SimDelphes collections (`ReconstructedParticles`, `EFlowTrack` with track states and covariance,
+`EFlowPhoton`, `EFlowNeutralHadron`, `Particle`, `RecoMCLink`, `Jet`, `Muon`, `Electron`, `Photon`, `MissingET`,
+`magFieldBz`, ...), plus the ARC result in **`EFlowTrack_PID`**: one `edm4hep::ParticleID` per track, linked to its
+`ReconstructedParticle` (`particle` relation), with
+
+| field | meaning |
+|---|---|
+| `type`, `algorithmType` | 1023 (ARC) |
+| `PDG` | best pi/K/p hypothesis (signed), 0 = no ring in either radiator |
+| `likelihood` | P(K) |
+| `parameters[0..9]` | P(pi), P(K), P(p), measured Cherenkov angle gas / aerogel [rad], per-track resolution gas / aerogel [rad], expected photons gas / aerogel, mass of the best hypothesis [GeV]; -1 = no ring |
+
+The probabilities are exp(-chi2/2) normalised over the three hypotheses with equal priors. In FCCAnalyses, the
+parameters are read from `EFlowTrack_PID`, `_EFlowTrack_PID_particle` (index into `ReconstructedParticles`) and
+`_EFlowTrack_PID_parameters`.
